The '''1997 Intercontinental Cup''' was an [[association football]] match played on 2 December 1997 between [[Borussia Dortmund]], winners of the [[1996–97 UEFA Champions League]], and [[Cruzeiro Esporte Clube|Cruzeiro]], winners of the [[1997 Copa Libertadores]]. The match was played at the neutral venue of the [[National Stadium (Tokyo, 1958)|National Stadium]] in [[Tokyo]] in front of 46,953 fans. [[Andreas Möller]] was named as [[man of the match]].<ref name="bor_cru"/>

